# Claude Code Configuration Template
# This file contains environment variables and configuration options for Claude Code CLI

# ============================================
# Authentication
# ============================================

# Anthropic API Key (REQUIRED)
# Get your API key from: https://console.anthropic.com/
#
# IMPORTANT: Never commit your actual API key to version control!
#
# Setup methods (choose one):
#
# Method 1: Environment variable in devcontainer.json (RECOMMENDED for devcontainers)
# Add to .devcontainer/devcontainer.json:
# {
#   "containerEnv": {
#     "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY": "${localEnv:ANTHROPIC_API_KEY}"
#   }
# }
# Then set on host: export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY='sk-ant-...'
#
# Method 2: Shell environment (for manual setup)
# export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY='sk-ant-api03-...'
#
# Method 3: Claude Code configuration file (fallback)
# Create ~/.config/claude/config.json:
# {
#   "apiKey": "sk-ant-api03-..."
# }

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY='${ANTHROPIC_API_KEY}'

# ============================================
# Claude Code CLI Configuration
# ============================================

# Model Selection (optional)
# Available models:
#   - claude-opus-4-20250514 (most capable, highest cost)
#   - claude-sonnet-4-20250514 (balanced performance/cost) [DEFAULT]
#   - claude-haiku-4-20250309 (fast, lower cost)
#
# CLAUDE_MODEL='claude-sonnet-4-20250514'

# Max Tokens (optional)
# Maximum tokens for Claude responses
# Default: 8192
# Range: 1-200000
#
# CLAUDE_MAX_TOKENS=8192

# Temperature (optional)
# Controls randomness in responses
# Default: 1.0
# Range: 0.0-1.0 (lower = more deterministic)
#
# CLAUDE_TEMPERATURE=1.0

# ============================================
# Devcontainer-Specific Settings
# ============================================

# Container Environment Flag
# Automatically set by Dockerfile, used for environment detection
DEVCONTAINER=true

# Workspace Directory
# Automatically set by devcontainer.json
WORKSPACE_DIR=/workspace

# ============================================
# Security Best Practices
# ============================================

# 1. API Key Management
#    - Never commit API keys to git
#    - Use environment variables or secrets management
#    - Rotate keys regularly (recommended: every 90 days)
#    - Use separate keys for dev/staging/production

# 2. Key Rotation Procedure
#    a. Generate new API key in Anthropic Console
#    b. Update environment variable on host machine
#    c. Rebuild devcontainer to pick up new key
#    d. Revoke old API key in Anthropic Console

# 3. Volume Storage (for persistent auth across rebuilds)
#    Claude Code configuration is stored in:
#    - Container: /home/vscode/.config/claude/
#    - Volume: cycletime-devcontainer-config (persistent)
#    This volume survives container rebuilds but NOT removals

# ============================================
# Usage Examples
# ============================================

# Basic usage:
#   claude                          # Start interactive session
#   claude --help                   # Show help and options
#   claude --version               # Show version information

# Model selection:
#   claude --model claude-opus-4-20250514    # Use Opus model
#   claude --model claude-haiku-4-20250309   # Use Haiku model

# File operations:
#   claude "Review the authentication code"  # Claude will read relevant files
#   claude "Add tests for UserService"       # Claude can create/modify files

# Testing connectivity:
#   claude --help                   # Verifies CLI works (no API call)
#   claude "Say hello"             # Simple API test (uses tokens)

# ============================================
# Troubleshooting
# ============================================

# Issue: "Authentication failed"
# Solution: Verify ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set correctly
#   echo $ANTHROPIC_API_KEY  # Should start with 'sk-ant-'

# Issue: "Command not found: claude"
# Solution: Verify installation
#   which claude                 # Should show /usr/local/bin/claude
#   npm list -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code  # Check installed version

# Issue: "API rate limit exceeded"
# Solution: Wait for rate limit reset or upgrade plan
#   https://console.anthropic.com/settings/plans

# Issue: Claude not seeing project files
# Solution: Verify working directory
#   pwd                          # Should be /workspace
#   ls -la                       # Should show project files

